ja|// AppEnum にすると、Siriは決まった選択肢の中から値を選ぶ。フレーズにも埋め込める
en|// As an AppEnum, Siri picks a value from a fixed set of choices. It can also go in phrases
ja|static let typeDisplayRepresentation: TypeDisplayRepresentation = "優先度"
en|static let typeDisplayRepresentation: TypeDisplayRepresentation = "Priority"
ja|.low: "低",
en|.low: "Low",
ja|.normal: "通常",
en|.normal: "Normal",
ja|.high: "高",
en|.high: "High",
